# Skills (intention-base theme)

## Default

For **standard theme work** — Twig templates, CSS/JS under `css/`/`js/`, page blueprints, theme `blueprints.yaml` / `intention-base.yaml`, and Badger panel Twig/YAML overrides — **no project skill is required**.

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and the always-applied scope / grav-core / changelog rules.

## When a skill *is* required

If the task involves any of the following, **do not implement yet** until an Admin Next / API skill exists in this repo’s `.cursor/skills/`:

- `onApi*` event handlers
- Admin Next custom fields, widgets, or `admin-next/` assets
- Blueprint injection via `onApiBlueprintResolved` (or similar)

Until then, use a **user-layer** approach that stays within normal theme blueprints and Twig, or ask the user to open the **grav-admin** / **badger-builder** workspace where those skills already live.

## Do not

- Copy Badger Builder skills into this theme “just in case”
- Invent Admin Next integration patterns from memory without a local skill file
